{{draft categories| [[Category:Wisdom Kings]] [[Category:Dharmapalas]] [[Category:Wrathful deities]] [[Category:Vajrayana deities]] [[Category:Pages and Categories from Wikipedia 1]] [[Category:qq]] [[Category:Wisdom King]]
