 Rock Carvings|1=Dazu Rock Carvings}} File:KongoYashaMyoo.jpg|{{ill|Vajrayakṣa|en|Vajrayakṣa|WD=Q11646516|lt=Vajrayakṣa|1=Vajrayakṣa}} File:Ususama Myoo (Kyoto National Museum).jpg|{{ill|Heian period|en|Heian period|WD=Q193292|lt=Heian period|1=Heian period}} painting of {{ill|Ucchusma|en|Ucchusma|WD=Q667619|lt=Ucchuṣma|1=Ucchusma}} at the {{ill|Kyoto National Museum|en|Kyoto National Museum|WD=Q147286|lt=Kyoto National Museum|1=Kyoto National Museum}} File:Daigensui Myoo (Akishinodera Nara).jpg|Statue of Āṭavaka at {{ill|Akishino-dera|en|Akishino-dera|WD=Q4301475|lt=Akishino-dera|1=Akishino-dera}}, {{ill|Nara (city)|en|Nara (city)|WD=Q169134|lt=Nara|1=Nara (city)}}, Japan File:法華寺 (岐阜市)-三田洞弘法-両頭愛染明王坐像Mitahorakobo028.jpg|Statue of Two-Headed Rāgarāja, the combined form of Acala and Rāgarāja, at {{ill|Hokke-ji (Gifu)|en|Hokke-ji (Gifu)|WD=Q3139220|lt=Hokke-ji|1=Hokke-ji (Gifu)}} (Mitahora Kōbō) in {{ill|Gifu|en|Gifu|WD=Q45798|lt=Gifu|1=Gifu}}, Japan File:Dazu 2007 728.jpg|The Wisdom Queen [[Mahamayuri|Mahāmāyūrī]] surrounded by various devas, part of the Dazu Rock Carvings </gallery>
